    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "It's about the size of a pea, firm, on the outer side. And it's a little tender when I press it.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:09",
      "end_timestamp": "01:20",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Thank you. And how long do you think it has been there?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:23",
      "end_timestamp": "01:29",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "That's the thing, I really can't say. It might have been last month, or the month before. I only noticed it last week.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:31",
      "end_timestamp": "01:42",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That's very common. These lumps are usually found by accident. Have you seen any fluid from the nipple?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:45",
      "end_timestamp": "01:56",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
